                            | Choosing the right procurement platform for a business, irrespective of the size or industry,
                            | can be challenging and time-consuming like walking through a minefield . 
                            |Even small missteps can cause disasters like revenue loss to customer churn and legal complications.
                    .content-item
                        h4.content-item__title 
                            |Benefit #1: Make your patient feel special:
                        p.content-item__desc
                            | Features & Advantages: Appointments Booking, Video Consultation, Patient Profile,
                            | Loyalty Programs, Reports, Lab Results, Eye Measurements, Dashboard, Smart Watch integration, Vaccines reminder, Family medical files, To-Do List, Medical New, Allergies recorded, 
                            |Hydration Control, Climate Medical Advice, Log in & Settings, … etc.
                .content-photo
                    img(src="/assets/images/servicesDetails.png")
